  # Testing: Star browser verification runbook
#
# Shared unattended suite:
#   /Users/admin/code/bin/star-app-verify dealstar
#
# Codex Playwright MCP is useful when you need:
# - exploratory clicking through a new flow
# - live DOM snapshots for selector design
# - screenshots, console logs, and network inspection
# - reproduction of a flaky or partially failing browser step

Load examples/business/data/star_browser_verification_request.txt as Verification Request
Alias Verification Request as Request

target app is the star application that needs browser verification
verification mode is the requested style of browser testing
requested surface is the page or workflow to inspect
production blocker is whether the issue blocks release

Find target app and save as target_app
Find verification mode and save as verification_mode
Find requested surface and save as requested_surface
Find production blocker and save as production_blocker

runbook equals "shared_playwright_suite"

If target_app is missing
  runbook equals "triage_request"

If requested_surface is missing
  runbook equals "triage_request"

If verification_mode is exploratory
  runbook equals "codex_playwright_mcp"

If production_blocker is yes
  runbook equals "codex_playwright_mcp"

If target_app is dealstar
  Route runbook to star_browser_verification_queue
Otherwise
  Route runbook to star_app_onboarding_queue

Notify qa team if runbook equals "codex_playwright_mcp"
